{
  "title": "Suprascapular Neuropathy",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/shoulder-and-elbow/3063/suprascapular-neuropathy",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Apr 16 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Suprascapular neuropathy is compression of the suprascapular nerve that most commonly occurs at the suprascapular notch or spinoglenoid notch by a mass (i.e cyst).",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be suspected clincally with weakness and atrophy of the infraspinatous or supraspinatous and confirmed with MRI studies showing cysts in the suprascapular notch or spinoglenoid notch.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment of suprascapular nerve compression at the suprascapular notch requires decompression of a cyst when present. Treatment of a spinoglenoid cyst requires either decompression or repair of an associated labral lesion (if present).",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "suprascapular notch entrapment",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "weakness of both **supraspinatus and infraspinatus**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "spinoglenoid notch entrapment",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "weakness of **infraspinatus only**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "SLAP tears",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Anatomy",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Suprascapular nerve (C5,C6)",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "emerges off **superior trunk** (C5,C6) of **brachial plexus**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "travels across posterior triangle of neck to scapula",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "2",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "innervates",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "supraspinatus",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "infraspinatus",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Suprascapular ligament**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "arises from medial base of coracoid and overlies suprascapular notch",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "suprascapular artery runs above",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "suprascapular nerve runs below",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Spinoglenoid ligament**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "arises near spinoglenoid notch",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "overlies distal suprascapular nerve",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Suprascapular notch entrapment",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Introduction",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "proximal compression of suprascapular nerve in the **suprascapular notch**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "leads to weakness of both **supraspinatus and infraspinatus**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pathoanatomy",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "compression can be from",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**ganglion cyst (often associated with labral tears)**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**transverse scapular ligament entrapment**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "fracture callus",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Presentation",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "symptoms",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "deep, diffuse, posterolateral shoulder pain",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "physical exam",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "pain with palpation of suprascapular notch",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**weakness of supraspinatus**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "weakness seen with shoulder abduction to 90 degree, 30 degrees forward flexion, and with internal rotation (Jobe test positive)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "**weakness of infraspinatus**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "weakness to external rotation with elbow at side",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "atrophy along the posterior scapula",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evaluation",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "MRI",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "important to identify a **compressive mass with associated cys**t",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "EMG/NCV",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**diagnostic**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "nonoperative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**activity modification and organized shoulder rehab program**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "no structural lesion seen on MRI",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "technique",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "rehab should be performed for a minimum of 6 months",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "operative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**surgical nerve decompression at suprascapular notch**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "**structural lesion** seen on MRI (cyst)",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "4",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "failure of extended nonoperative management (~ 1 year)",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spinoglenoid notch entrapment",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Introduction",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "distal compression of suprascapular nerve",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "affects **infraspinatus only**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Pathoanatomy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "compression can be due to",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "**posterior labral tears causing a cyst**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**spinoglenoid ligament**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**spinoglenoid notch ganglion**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**traction injury** (seen in 45% of volley ball players)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "transglenoid fixation",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "3",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "lies 1.5cm medial to glenoid labrum",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "3",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Presentation",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "symptoms",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "deep, diffuse, posterolateral shoulder pain",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "physical exam",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**infraspinatus weakness**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "weakness to external rotation with elbow at side",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "**infraspinatus atrophy along the posterior scapula**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [
                    {
                      "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3063/images/clinical%20image,%20infraspinatus%20atrophy%20smaller.jpg",
                      "caption": "Shows atrophy of infraspinatus"
                    }
                  ],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "supraspinatus strength is normal",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evaluation",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "MRI",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "important to identify **posterior labral lesions with associated cyst**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "EMG/NCV",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**diagnostic**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "nonoperative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**activity modification and organized shoulder rehab program**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "no structural lesion seen on MRI",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "technique",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "posterior shoulder capsule stretching",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "operative",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "labral repair with **arthroscopic cyst decompression**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "labral lesion with associated cyst seen on MRI",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "spinoglenoid ligament release with nerve decompression",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "indications",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "no structural lesion seen on MRI and failure of extended nonoperative management (~ 1 year)",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "technique",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "posterior approach commonly utilized",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "decompress nerve in spinoglenoid notch",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
